{"guid":"wa-1to1-+15167053816-75","timestamp_unix_ms":1781622624853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+15167053816","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" \"No, no, nonsense, Lizzy.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+15167053816-76","timestamp_unix_ms":1781623731853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"On the contrary, she was as much disposed to complain of it as her husband. Its banks were neither formal nor falsely adorned.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+15167053816-77","timestamp_unix_ms":1781624106853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Her prudent mother, occupied by the same ideas, forbore to invite him to sit by herself. A few weeks, he believed.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+15167053816-78","timestamp_unix_ms":1781626387853,"direction":"incoming","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":"+15167053816","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"She was now in an irritation as violent from delight as she had ever been fidgety from alarm and vexation.  \"Lizzy,\" cried her mother, \"remember where you are, and do not run on in the wild manner that you are suffered to do at home.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"wa-1to1-+15167053816-79","timestamp_unix_ms":1781627130853,"direction":"outgoing","service":"whatsapp","message_kind":"sms","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Why does she not come in?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
